sections.text:
Excited, tremulous feeling. Frontal pain;
worse, stooping. Strengthens brain after delirium
tremens.

Compare: Teucrium scorodonia (in
tuberculosis with muco-purulent expectoration; dropsy;
orchitis and tuberculous epididymitis; especially in
young, thin individuals with tuberculosis of lungs,
glands; bones and urogcnitals, 3x). Ctna; Ignat;
Sang.; Sil. *
